[en.DECISION_C01_C02_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION]
Loyalty Investigation Against Trixie

[en.DECISION_C01_C02_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION_desc]
The Ministry of Order starts a secret investigation and try to find evidence of Trixie’s disloyalty.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION]
针对特丽克西的忠诚调查

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION_desc]
秩序部开展秘密调查，试图找到特丽克西不忠的证据。
